*** Test Cases ***
CB007103_C002_Rel16_DMRS_Act_For_PUSCH_And_PUCCH_F3_When_Halfpi_BPSK_And_Halfpi_BPSK_AndRel16_Is_Always_SW_On_For_PUCCH_F3_R16_DMRS_MFBI_N77_N78
    [Documentation]
    ...    1. User Scenario CB007103-C #2 Performance comparison between Rel16 DMRS and Rel15 DMRS for PUSCH and PUCCH F3 activated togather in the
    ...    case when pi/2-BPSK configured in NIDD for PUCCH F3 and pi/2-BPSK and Rel16 DMRS is always switched on for PUCCH F3 by NIDD parameter.
    ...    2. Configuration
    ...    MFBI ,5GC001416 and CB007219 enable on all TDD cells with native band n77, alternative band n78
    ...    NRCELL.actUlDftSOfdm is set to TRUE,(NRCELL.actRel16DmrsForPucchF3)=true,(NRCELL.actRel16DmrsForPusch)=true,
    ...    NRCELL.ulTransPrecodeCtl.ulTransPrecodePi2Bpsk =false,NRCELL.ulTransPrecodeCtl.ulTransPrePi2BpskPwrBoost= false
    ...    NRCELL.pucchF3Rel16Pi2BpskAlwaysOn is TRUE,pucchF3ModulationScheme = pi/2-BPSK
    ...    3. Test Case Steps:
    ...      a. ue_register id=1 to alternative band n78 and PDU session is setup
    ...      b. trigger tranform precoding switching on for UE1
    ...      c. tirgger gNB signals to UE MCS 0 or 1 and PUSCH is not scheduled by fallback DCI (DCI 0_0)
    ...      d. trigger tranform precoding switching off for UE1
    ...      e. check counter
   [Tags]    C002    christine.chen    QC_364063
    Deactive Pathloss
    Update UE capa    ${n78_7103}    ue_id=1
    Start To Capture GNB BIP Log    tag=gnb_bip
